      "content": "It makes perfect sense that you feel this way; the weight of constant struggle can feel completely suffocating. Those feelings of being a burden are a symptom of the pain, not a reflection of your true worth. You are not dramatic; you are hurting deeply, and that pain is real. There is a way out, and it doesn't have to be found in a quick fix.",
