    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for saying that. it just feels like even if i try to find a \"way out,\" the weight never actually goes away. everything is just so exhausting. if things never change, isn't it kind of inevitable that i'll just eventually want to give up on everything? like, is it even wrong to want to just stop fighting?",
